Textus Change Management
========================

This executable model defines a reusable workflow for turning an observed
finding into a reviewed, delivery-ready change. It deliberately keeps artifact
formats and delivery providers outside the generic core.

# COMPONENT

## ChangeManagement

### PACKAGE

org.simplemodeling.textus.changemanagement

### DESCRIPTION

Owns provider-neutral change proposals, their semantic evidence, and the state
transitions that lead to a delivery-ready candidate.

# SERVICE

## ChangeManagement

### DESCRIPTION

Creates and advances change proposals while preserving source patches,
candidate artifacts, semantic diffs, and reviews as distinct evidence.

### OPERATION

#### createProposal

##### DESCRIPTION

Creates a detected proposal from a finding and a provider-neutral source artifact.

##### TYPE
COMMAND

##### INPUT
###### TYPE
CreateProposal

##### OUTPUT
###### TYPE
ChangeProposalResult

#### recordGuidance

##### DESCRIPTION

Records actionable guidance for a detected proposal and advances it to Guided.

##### TYPE
COMMAND

##### INPUT
###### TYPE
RecordGuidance

##### OUTPUT
###### TYPE
ChangeProposalResult

#### attachProposedPatch

##### DESCRIPTION

Attaches the proposed byte-level patch as evidence and advances a guided proposal.

##### TYPE
COMMAND

##### INPUT
###### TYPE
AttachProposedPatch

##### OUTPUT
###### TYPE
ChangeProposalResult

#### attachCandidateArtifact

##### DESCRIPTION

Attaches the candidate produced from the patch without assuming its media format.

##### TYPE
COMMAND

##### INPUT
###### TYPE
AttachCandidateArtifact

##### OUTPUT
###### TYPE
ChangeProposalResult

#### attachSemanticDiff

##### DESCRIPTION

Records the semantic comparison between source and candidate as separate evidence.

##### TYPE
COMMAND

##### INPUT
###### TYPE
AttachSemanticDiff

##### OUTPUT
###### TYPE
ChangeProposalResult

#### recordCandidateReview

##### DESCRIPTION

Records an accepted or rejected semantic review after a semantic diff exists.

##### TYPE
COMMAND

##### INPUT
###### TYPE
RecordCandidateReview

##### OUTPUT
###### TYPE
ChangeProposalResult

#### markReadyForDelivery

##### DESCRIPTION

Marks a reviewed proposal ready for a provider-specific delivery operation.

##### TYPE
COMMAND

##### INPUT
###### TYPE
MarkReadyForDelivery

##### OUTPUT
###### TYPE
ChangeProposalResult

#### getProposal

##### DESCRIPTION

Loads one retained change proposal by its public proposal identifier.

##### TYPE
QUERY

##### INPUT
###### TYPE
GetProposal

##### OUTPUT
###### TYPE
ChangeProposalResult

#### listProposals

##### DESCRIPTION

Lists retained proposals with an optional lifecycle-state filter and result limit.

##### TYPE
QUERY

##### INPUT
###### TYPE
ListProposals

##### OUTPUT
###### TYPE
ChangeProposalListResult

# ENTITY

## ChangeProposal

### DESCRIPTION

Aggregate root for one governed change. `proposedPatch`, `semanticDiff`, and
`reviewResult` intentionally remain separate: byte changes, meaning changes,
and acceptance evidence are not interchangeable.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name               | type                | multiplicity |
|--------------------+---------------------+--------------|
| id                 | entityid            | 1            |
| proposalId         | ProposalId          | 1            |
| subject            | ChangeSubject       | 1            |
| originatingFinding | FindingStatement    | 1            |
| guidance           | GuidanceStatement   | ?            |
| sourceTarget       | ChangeArtifact      | 1            |
| proposedPatch      | ChangeArtifact      | ?            |
| candidateArtifact  | ChangeArtifact      | ?            |
| semanticDiff       | SemanticDiff        | ?            |
| reviewResult       | CandidateReview     | ?            |
| readiness          | DeliveryReadiness   | 1            |
| delivery           | ChangeDelivery      | ?            |
| verificationResult | VerificationResult  | ?            |
| state              | ChangeProposalState | 1            |
| revision           | int                 | 1            |

### STATEMACHINE

#### proposalLifecycle

##### STATE

###### Detected
####### TRANSITION
- on :: recordGuidance
- to :: Guided

###### Guided
####### TRANSITION
- on :: attachProposedPatch
- to :: Proposed

###### Proposed
####### TRANSITION
- on :: attachCandidateArtifact
- to :: CandidateBuilt

###### CandidateBuilt
####### TRANSITION
- on :: attachSemanticDiff
- to :: CandidateBuilt
####### TRANSITION
- on :: recordCandidateReview
- to :: Reviewed
####### TRANSITION
- on :: failBuild
- to :: BuildFailed

###### Reviewed
####### TRANSITION
- on :: markReadyForDelivery
- to :: ReadyForDelivery
####### TRANSITION
- on :: rejectCandidate
- to :: Rejected
####### TRANSITION
- on :: failReview
- to :: ReviewFailed

###### ReadyForDelivery
####### TRANSITION
- on :: recordDelivery
- to :: Delivered

###### Delivered
####### TRANSITION
- on :: recordMerge
- to :: Merged
####### TRANSITION
- on :: failDelivery
- to :: DeliveryFailed

###### Merged
####### TRANSITION
- on :: verifyChange
- to :: Verified
####### TRANSITION
- on :: failVerification
- to :: VerificationFailed

###### Verified
###### Rejected
###### BuildFailed
###### ReviewFailed
###### DeliveryFailed
###### ClosedWithoutMerge
###### VerificationFailed

##### EVENT

###### recordGuidance
###### attachProposedPatch
###### attachCandidateArtifact
###### attachSemanticDiff
###### recordCandidateReview
###### markReadyForDelivery
###### recordDelivery
###### recordMerge
###### verifyChange
###### rejectCandidate
###### failBuild
###### failReview
###### failDelivery
###### failVerification

# POWERTYPE

## ChangeProposalState

package = org.simplemodeling.textus.changemanagement.value

| name               | label                |
| ------------------ | -------------------- |
| Detected           | Detected             |
| Guided             | Guided               |
| Proposed           | Proposed             |
| CandidateBuilt     | Candidate built      |
| Reviewed           | Reviewed             |
| ReadyForDelivery   | Ready for delivery   |
| Delivered          | Delivered            |
| Merged             | Merged               |
| Verified           | Verified             |
| Rejected           | Rejected             |
| BuildFailed        | Build failed         |
| ReviewFailed       | Review failed        |
| DeliveryFailed     | Delivery failed      |
| ClosedWithoutMerge | Closed without merge |
| VerificationFailed | Verification failed  |

## ChangeArtifactKind

package = org.simplemodeling.textus.changemanagement.value

| name      | label     |
| --------- | --------- |
| Source    | Source    |
| Patch     | Patch     |
| Candidate | Candidate |
| Evidence  | Evidence  |

## ReviewDecision

package = org.simplemodeling.textus.changemanagement.value

| name     | label    |
| -------- | -------- |
| Accepted | Accepted |
| Rejected | Rejected |

## DeliveryReadiness

package = org.simplemodeling.textus.changemanagement.value

| name     | label     |
| -------- | --------- |
| NotReady | Not ready |
| Ready    | Ready     |

## DeliveryStatus

package = org.simplemodeling.textus.changemanagement.value

| name      | label     |
| --------- | --------- |
| Prepared  | Prepared  |
| Submitted | Submitted |
| Merged    | Merged    |
| Failed    | Failed    |

## VerificationStatus

package = org.simplemodeling.textus.changemanagement.value

| name      | label     |
| --------- | --------- |
| Pending   | Pending   |
| Succeeded | Succeeded |
| Failed    | Failed    |

